  abstract={New developers struggle in process of how to start and reach to deployment so our research aims to develop a web-based platform that empowers users to create and deploy cloud-based projects through a natural language interface. Users can input prompts detailing their project requirements, which can be interpreted using advanced Natural Language Processing (NLP) models to generate actionable steps. The platform is expected to create architecture diagrams, and help refining through an interactive conversation. Once the architecture is finalized, the system can generate deployment-ready templates, such as CloudFormation for AWS, enabling users to deploy their projects with a single click. The designing will help integrate real-time communication, tools to be use in security, and can offer a user-friendly interface. The design generated will help both novice and experienced users a seamless experience of design and deployment phases.},
